                <pb facs="1269" n="1119" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg1119"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Riddle to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April 4,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Riddle states that the Russian Government is sending instructions by
                    telegraph to Russian ambassador to Turkey that if Turkish Government ratifies
                    the convention it should at the same time assent to Russian circular regarding
                    nonsignatories.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
